    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO BRAINROT ROYALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Brainrot Royale, the ultimate chaotic battle where your imagination collides with the unpredictable power of AI. Ever wondered who would win in a wild showdown between your favorite meme-fueled Italian characters? Time to find out. Pick your fighter and prove what you\u2019re made of! Matches are up to 16 players at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rack up the highest score and crush the competition! Each match is a fast-paced, point-based free-for-all where eliminations are key. Master your character\u2019s unique abilities, outsmart your rivals, and climb the scoreboard to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brainrot Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the famous Italian Brainrot characters and duke it out between each other. Tralalero Tralala, Tung Tung Sahur, Bombardiro Crocodilo... you name it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/d464a2f9bee55932e6b37d58ae85a247.avif?t=1751812154\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iconic Locations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle across chaotic, meme-inspired maps like the mysterious Boscolini Fungolini or the sunny shores of Playa Nabolini. If they look familiar\u2026 it\u2019s because they are. Just be warned: this is high-risk tourism, folks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/e7160111cf6879e493458a2a872345f6.avif?t=1751812154\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Super Attacks</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect powerful items scattered across the map to turn the tide in your favor. Grab the Super Attack Booster and unleash devastating abilities on your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/627e0b99b629e1eaa117da99dc50ded7.avif?t=1751812154\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect the unexpected\u2014random characters may crash the party to lend a hand, give you a boost, or throw a wrench in your plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/2ea0346bbb285b4be2e391525fb74b86.poster.avif?t=1751812154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/2ea0346bbb285b4be2e391525fb74b86.webm?t=1751812154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/2ea0346bbb285b4be2e391525fb74b86.mp4?t=1751812154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JOIN US IN EARLY ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re building Brainrot Royale with our community. Got a favorite meme, character, or idea? Share it! Your feedback will help shape future updates and content.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO BRAINROT ROYALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Brainrot Royale, the ultimate chaotic battle where your imagination collides with the unpredictable power of AI. Ever wondered who would win in a wild showdown between your favorite meme-fueled Italian characters? Time to find out. Pick your fighter and prove what you\u2019re made of! Matches are up to 16 players at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rack up the highest score and crush the competition! Each match is a fast-paced, point-based free-for-all where eliminations are key. Master your character\u2019s unique abilities, outsmart your rivals, and climb the scoreboard to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brainrot Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the famous Italian Brainrot characters and duke it out between each other. Tralalero Tralala, Tung Tung Sahur, Bombardiro Crocodilo... you name it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/d464a2f9bee55932e6b37d58ae85a247.avif?t=1751812154\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iconic Locations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle across chaotic, meme-inspired maps like the mysterious Boscolini Fungolini or the sunny shores of Playa Nabolini. If they look familiar\u2026 it\u2019s because they are. Just be warned: this is high-risk tourism, folks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/e7160111cf6879e493458a2a872345f6.avif?t=1751812154\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Super Attacks</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect powerful items scattered across the map to turn the tide in your favor. Grab the Super Attack Booster and unleash devastating abilities on your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/627e0b99b629e1eaa117da99dc50ded7.avif?t=1751812154\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect the unexpected\u2014random characters may crash the party to lend a hand, give you a boost, or throw a wrench in your plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/2ea0346bbb285b4be2e391525fb74b86.poster.avif?t=1751812154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/2ea0346bbb285b4be2e391525fb74b86.webm?t=1751812154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878000/extras/2ea0346bbb285b4be2e391525fb74b86.mp4?t=1751812154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JOIN US IN EARLY ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re building Brainrot Royale with our community. Got a favorite meme, character, or idea? Share it! Your feedback will help shape future updates and content.</p>",
